<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.berwilson.cron-voice-memo-sweep</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/zsh</string>
    <string>-c</string>
    <string>curl -sS -m 1700 -H "Authorization: Bearer $(grep '^CRON_SECRET=' __APP_DIR__/.env.local | cut -d= -f2-)" http://localhost:3000/api/cron/voice-memo-sweep</string>
  </array>
  <!--
    :50 past the four snapshot hours — five minutes behind the notes sweep.

    bw-snapshot runs at 04:35 / 11:35 / 15:35 / 19:35 and copies all three local
    stores; the text sweep reads chat.db at :40, the notes sweep reads
    NoteStore.sqlite at :45, and this reads CloudRecordings.db at :50. Spaced
    rather than parallel: each new recording costs whisper AND a summarize pass,
    and LM Studio serves one request at a time (§12), so two sweeps at the same
    minute queue behind each other while holding two corpora in memory on a box
    that already pages.

    ⚠ A MEETING IS THE LONGEST AUDIO THIS BOX TRANSCRIBES. whisper measured ~32x
    realtime here (a 16-minute call in 29.7s with the chat model resident), so an
    hour-long meeting is about two minutes — but the per-run ceiling in sweep.ts
    is what keeps a first run against a full memo library from transcribing for
    an hour inside one cron. The rest arrive on the next run, newest first.

    ⚠ TWO HUMAN REQUIREMENTS, BOTH OF WHICH FAIL SILENTLY. Voice Memos syncs from
    the phone only while Voice Memos.app is RUNNING on the Studio (the same trap
    Notes set on 10-12, when the local store sat eleven days behind the phone),
    and bw-snapshot must hold Full Disk Access. Either failure leaves this route
    reporting success having read nothing new, so it reports the snapshot's AGE
    and the health page watches it — a liveness check needs a clock, not a count.
  -->
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <array>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>4</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>50</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>11</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>50</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>15</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>50</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>19</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>50</integer></dict>
  </array>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>__LOG_DIR__/cron-voice-memo-sweep.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>__LOG_DIR__/cron-voice-memo-sweep.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
